    "chunk_text": "twentigo\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es by\u00f0 sancte Lucian tyd. JU25A2 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s haliges hades f\u00e6mne on Rome, ac heo w\u00e6s gehergod fram \u00e6l\u00feeodegum cyninge, se JU25A4 Heo w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e f\u00e6ger f\u00e6mne. JU25A5 \u00dea wolde se cyning hig gewemman myd hys fyrenlustum, ond \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 heo to hym, Ic h\u00e6bbe JU25A9 \u00dea yrsode se cyning wy\u00f0 hig \u00e6rest, ac \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan he ongan hyre arian ond het hyre JU25A14 \u00deonne swa oft swa se cyning wolde feran to gefeohte wy\u00f0 hys feondum, \u00feonne ferde he JU25A18 \u00deonne dyde heo swa. JU25A18 \u00deonne afylde he symle hys fynd ond he com eft ham symle gesund ond gesygef\u00e6sted. JU25A20 \u00dea \u00e6fter twentigum gearum \u00fea \u00e6tywde \u00feysse f\u00e6mnan heofonlicu gesyh\u00f0 ond hyre bebead JU25A22 \u00dea ge\u00ferowode heo \u00fe\u00e6r martyrdom for Cryste. JU25A23 \u00dea eode se cyning to Romeburge gerefan to \u00feam ylcan \u00fee hig \u00e6r gemartyrode ond b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t JU25A25 \u00dea fr\u00e6gn se burhgerefa hyne hw\u00e6t he w\u00e6re. JU25A26 Ic eom Aceia, mynre \u00feeode cyning. JU25A27 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se gerefa, Hu myht \u00feu for Cryste sweltan, nu \u00f0u eart h\u00e6\u00f0en? JU25A28 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se cyning, Ic gelyfe \u00fe\u00e6t mynes blodes agotenys",
